---
import { brochureLink, marketingLink } from "../data/project";
import ActionLink from "./ActionLink.astro";
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="kontak" tone="pine">
  <div class="contact-layout">
    <div>
      <h2 id="kontak-title">Coba alur kontak properti.</h2>
      <p class="contact-copy">Gunakan tombol berikut untuk melihat simulasi alur WhatsApp tanpa menghubungi nomor marketing asli.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-actions">
      <ActionLink href={marketingLink} variant="inverse" external>WhatsApp demo</ActionLink>
      <ActionLink href={brochureLink} variant="text" class="brochure-link" external>Minta brosur &amp; harga</ActionLink>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="contact-note">Nomor WhatsApp pada demo ini adalah nomor dummy dan tidak terhubung ke tim marketing. Harga, spesifikasi, ketersediaan, dan dokumen legal tetap perlu dikonfirmasi kepada pengelola proyek.</p>
</Section>

<style>
  .contact-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr); align-items: center; gap: var(--space-12); }
  h2 { max-inline-size: 20ch; }
  .contact-copy { margin-block-start: var(--space-4); max-inline-size: 48ch; }
  .contact-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-self: end; gap: var(--space-3); }
  .contact-actions :global(.brochure-link) { color: var(--canvas); }
  .contact-actions :global(.brochure-link:hover), .contact-actions :global(.brochure-link:active) { color: var(--canvas); }
  .contact-note { margin-block-start: var(--space-8); max-inline-size: 76ch; font-size: var(--text-small); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .contact-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-8); }
    .contact-actions { justify-self: start; }
  }
</style>
